: "You can see it from the south of Spain.", "x": 0.1320766994581853, "h": 0.016384102222291107}, {"h": 0.010234971326180753, "text": "3 North and South A", "x": 0.11091234693136433, "y": 0.6120348840985089, "w": 0.1502683342827691}, {"x": 0.3703041157486081, "text": "- with natural", "w": 0.10375670539008247, "h": 0.010207581227436872, "y": 0.6132400721880759}, {"x": 0.13059034617865348, "h": 0.01152233217597445, "y": 0.6258032490053542, "w": 0.343470458984375, "text": "sights like the Niagara Falls and the Amazon River."}, {"y": 0.6392618212697007, "x": 0.18952818337653796, "h": 0.01455362516189745, "text": "_ - the biggest continent from Istanbul,", "w": 0.27223678588867184}, {"text": "Turkey to Tokyo in Japan. Here you can find the", "x": 0.13237924988586383, "y": 0.652500000240142, "w": 0.3220035807291667, "h": 0.012645348314774147}, {"y": 0.6676744188658689, "text": "world's highest mountains in the Himalayas.", "x": 0.13059034462967284, "h": 0.012700130009909388, "w": 0.2969588555230035}, {"text": "5 A", "y": 0.680319767572024, "x": 0.10912343503951223, "w": 0.032200357649061415, "h": 0.008851743820341854}, {"h": 0.010234971700592574, "y": 0.6827301443378897, "text": "- the continent is also", "x": 0.30053667552408947, "w": 0.1502683342827691}, {"y": 0.694145813040763, "h": 0.013082743723900343, "text": "known as Australasia and Oceania. This land is", "x": 0.12866046290353128, "w": 0.3187025960286458}, {"w": 0.354582282172309, "x": 0.12862138618945917, "h": 0.015189643061117992, "text": "famous for its kangaroos and the Great Barrier Reef,", "y": 0.7076090156212387}, {"x": 0.1288014316359665, "text": "the world's largest coral reef.", "y": 0.7219900721307262, "h": 0.012704694839160775, "w": 0.19499104817708332}, {"x": 0.10675438703647261, "h": 0.015636839074778693, "y": 0.7345391662267402, "w": 0.14940717909071183, "text": "6 The two biggest o"}, {"w": 0.06440071529812282, "x": 0.10554561784288848, "y": 0.7498646208460152, "text": "7 The P", "h": 0.010207581227436775}, {"h": 0.010294318224979204, "w": 0.20214669121636286, "text": "- you can sail across this from", "x": 0.2862253996288491, "y": 0.7522202165129943}, {"x": 0.12863797127825635, "y": 0.7637105028299053, "h": 0.014624087974052515, "w": 0.34734690348307296, "text": "San Francisco to Japan. There are many islands like"}, {"y": 0.7768784814448585, "h": 0.01471945516469242, "w": 0.2598701985677083, "text": "Hawaii, Fiji and the Galapagos Islands.", "x": 0.12855616393222716}, {"x": 0.10554561882506439, "text": "8 The A", "y": 0.7914801442906925, "h": 0.009029783393501837, "w": 0.06261180453830295}, {"y": 0.7928633724284507, "x": 0.3041144881040237, "h": 0.010116278651819317, "text": "- from Ireland to the USA", "w": 0.17710196601019962}, {"text": "or from Angola to Brazil. Columbus sailed across this", "y": 0.805223296390376, "w": 0.3579512193467882, "h": 0.012963352771442269, "x": 0.12693469509613173}, {"y": 0.8193546934006753, "h": 0.012709259668412161, "text": "great sea. He wanted to get to India, but he found", "w": 0.343470458984375, "x": 0.1270125319121059}, {"text": "a new world.", "h": 0.008851743820341951, "w": 0.08944543626573351, "x": 0.1252236131134064, "y": 0.8333284886603232}, {"h": 0.006409411529341371, "w": 0.13416815016004774, "x": 0.0912343523573643, "text": "REMEMRER THIC", "y": 0.8624127907808632}, {"w": 0.41204542371961805, "text": "6 Read REMEMBER THIS. Find examples of the following", "h": 0.019088841431407752, "x": 0.53819638259886, "y": 0.053111894781610304}, {"text": "geographical places 1-4 in the sentences in Exercise 5.", "x": 0.5633075494743405, "h": 0.01690751051644557, "y": 0.06888167402238476, "w": 0.3850303480360243}, {"x": 0.5614593350531774, "h": 0.016464208386004618, "y": 0.08137488530370911, "w": 0.3100472344292534, "text": "Write their names and the or Ø in each gap."}, {"y": 0.10242732594709991, "x": 0.5813953591615576, "text": "countries: Portugal, Russia, Spain, Turkey, Japan,", "h": 0.017708053218758932, "w": 0.33631483289930564}, {"y": 0.11620938650489707, "w": 0.19499104817708335, "h": 0.01656677626530621, "x": 0.5813953536954475, "text": "Ireland, Angola, Brazil, India"}, {"x": 0.5831842645888287, "w": 0.30769229465060766, "text": "countries which are groups of states: the USA", "h": 0.013909883895075253, "y": 0.13530523261016583}, {"w": 0.04304777357313372, "x": 0.5813383667898253, "y": 0.15416508046349964, "text": "rivers:", "h": 0.011597164374396339}, {"h": 0.008851743820341854, "text": "cities:", "y": 0.1694476746804904, "w": 0.03935599009195967, "x": 0.5831842584871151}, {"y": 0.18334386269032182, "w": 0.1180679745144314, "h": 0.009029783393501837, "x": 0.5813953528143406, "text": "seas and oceans:"}, {"h": 0.008851743820341951, "w": 0.07871198018391934, "text": "continents:", "y": 0.19726744206439292, "x": 0.5831842616671339}, {"w": 0.0842625342475043, "h": 0.013270126370316352, "x": 0.8263839393004317, "text": "• North and", "y": 0.19821958790919691}, {"h": 0.011721001841961691, "x": 0.5795172661290634, "text": "South", "y": 0.20974269679659346, "w": 0.04311215718587236}, {"text": "REMEMBER BETTER", "w": 0.159212883843316, "y": 0.24026162809691057, "x": 0.5474060815769364, "h": 0.011394509094286501}, {"text": "Many geographical places may have similar names", "y": 0.2679811416737032, "x": 0.5489891824991291, "w": 0.3438549465603298, "h": 0.015558908992726071}, {"w": 0.37388193766276034, "h": 0.015311371841155162, "text": "in English and in your language but the spelling is often", "y": 0.2818862815963239, "x": 0.5438282581990314}, {"w": 0.35848405626085067, "h": 0.020939602628081314, "y": 0.29240333485167064, "text": "different. In order to remember the English spellings", "x": 0.5453112614027118}, {"w": 0.32796793619791664, "x": 0.5471455007157512, "h": 0.01797475052224168, "y": 0.30742424376867333, "text": "and the correct article use, it is useful to practise"}, {"text": "writing the names of places. One way is to make", "y": 0.32202895037248747, "w": 0.3296101209852431, "h": 0.016565699456831135, "x": 0.5454156008102276}, {"y": 0.3376308142147059, "h": 0.012645348314774147, "w": 0.2933810424804688, "text": "a 'wish list' of places you would like to visit.", "x": 0.5456171747347208}, {"x": 0.5453154154980229, "h": 0.018536890224429343, "text": "Use different colours for different kinds of places, e.g.", "y": 0.34819632379543397, "w": 0.3655669148763021}, {"text": "red for countries, blue for seas, black for cities, etc.", "x": 0.5438282594917373, "w": 0.34883721245659727, "y": 0.36418604625068185, "h": 0.013909883895075253}, {"h": 0.011531462208889044, "w": 0.2701252237955729, "y": 0.3855324910064512, "text": "WISH LIST - Ten places I want to visit:", "x": 0.5438282673687609}, {"y": 0.4059156979672495, "text": "Venice, the Amazon River, the Dead Sea, ...", "x": 0.5438282671136221, "h": 0.012645348314774242, "w": 0.2951699490017362}, {"x": 0.5420393552769993, "w": 0.23971377902560764, "y": 0.4463808141332608, "h": 0.011389943890623196, "text": "SHOW WHAT YOU'VE LEARNT"}, {"w": 0.2134561496310764, "y": 0.47378390266922554, "x": 0.5327828433972607, "h": 0.013755882311383718, "text": "7 Choose the correct option."}, {"y": 0.4982084836275649, "h": 0.011399074297949709, "w": 0.35957065158420143, "text": "1 We didn't swim in the sea because we heard that", "x": 0.5509839109699742}, {"y": 0.5119494581877079, "x": 0.5706619070662476, "w": 0.33273701985677084, "h": 0.012955776173285286, "text": "there was a four-metre long beaver / shark / deer"}, {"h": 0.010207581227436872, "y": 0.5272608302291301, "x": 0.5706619007104438, "w": 0.20572450425889754, "text": "swimming close to the beach."}, {"text": "This was a forest but people have cut down / cut", "y": 0.539824007356317, "h": 0.012955776173285189, "w": 0.3237924872504341, "x": 0.5706618918622607}, {"h": 0.012514109473796562, "text": "out / cut off all the trees.", "y": 0.5528445359504784, "x": 0.570538396163102, "w": 0.1702912055121527}, {"h": 0.018106217754446634, "x": 0.5471401730821882, "text": "3 Some people think that air / climate / global warming", "w": 0.37795054117838545, "y": 0.5667001786308575}, {"x": 0.5688729914618952, "y": 0.5816860465636542, "text": "doesn't exist! Isn't it stupid?", "w": 0.19320214165581606, "h": 0.013909883895075253}, {"text": "4 We should do more to destroy / protect / pollute", "h": 0.012668173958678463, "x": 0.5474060803606025, "w": 0.35778174506293403, "y": 0.5955731048498715}, {"h": 0.012756972467856368, "y": 0.6082416851802898, "x": 0.5705179469842299, "text": "the environment before it's too late.", "w": 0.24541169908311633}, {"x": 0.54740609434343, "y": 0.6234156978191775, "text": "5 They went on a safari in Africa where they saw", "w": 0.3363148328993055, "h": 0.013909883895075253}, {"w": 0.23434704250759542, "x": 0.5706618956513901, "text": "a family of dolphins / lions / bears.", "h": 0.012695564431834358, "y": 0.6360108304450295}, {"y": 0.6595032610743101, "text": "8 Complete the sentences with one word in each gap.", "x": 0.5275679341316905, "w": 0.3938852267795139, "h": 0.014774628494620818}, {"x": 0.5686799875540092, "text": "Last year we went sailing in the Mediterranean Sea", "y": 0.680109295586504, "w": 0.34206136067708337, "h": 0.014646900139130385}, {"w": 0.32379248725043397, "h": 0.012645348314774147, "text": "1 In the middle of the lake, there is a beautiful", "x": 0.5456171740178957, "y": 0.6980232562332379}, {"x": 0.6654740594782637, "y": 0.7131976746804904, "text": "with one tree on it.", "w": 0.12880143059624571, "h": 0.008851743820341854}, {"y": 0.7258430234860863, "text": "2 Climate", "x": 0.5438282654271713, "h": 0.008851743820341854, "w": 0.07692307366265194}, {"y": 0.727093862811061, "h": 0.011394509094286501, "x": 0.7209302312390863, "w": 0.17710196601019967, "text": "is a good phrase because"}, {"h": 0.011476680888165624, "text": "it isn't just temperatures that are different. There is", "w": 0.343470458984375, "x": 0.5670840864291007, "y": 0.7396570398227778}, {"x": 0.5670840823577417, "h": 0.012690999602582971, "w": 0.3363148328993055, "text": "more rain and there are stronger winds and other", "y": 0.7536627907481361}, {"x": 0.5652951721541494, "w": 0.046511624654134054, "y": 0.7675726746482089, "h": 0.012645348314774147, "text": "things."}, {"text": "3 There's a big problem with water", "x": 0.5438282722997103, "h": 0.012955776173285286, "y": 0.7800947656390068, "w": 0.24865831163194452}, {"y": 0.795392442064393, "text": "in our rivers.", "x": 0.5652951743800837, "w": 0.08586761474609372, "h": 0.009043478630079737}, {"text": "4 All the fish in the river have died because of the", "w": 0.3473820665147569, "h": 0.013461359468177817, "x": 0.5418830837970249, "y": 0.8076698965405803}, {"text": "waste from factories nearby.", "x": 0.6634205742874371, "y": 0.8208521848779513, "w": 0.19202872382269964, "h": 0.015259607156691501}, {"text": "People who live near the sea are very worried about", "x": 0.5633432062389818, "y": 0.8354786514725231, "h": 0.015268257568028888, "w": 0.35630835639105896}, {"text": "the effects of global", "x": 0.5617173561716923, "y": 0.8495848376470122, "h": 0.012955776173285189, "w": 0.13953487820095478}, {"x": 0.8032200390906482, "w": 0.09302324930826822, "y": 0.8522965116682762, "h": 0.010244102107919087, "text": "on sea levels."}, {"x": 0.09465022155892307, "text": "We use the definite article (the) with some geographical", "w": 0.3827160305447049, "h": 0.014587364166834704, "y": 0.8880813957181922}, {"y": 0.9026162792437696, "text": "places but not with others.", "x": 0.09465020566763918, "w": 0.17901234944661457, "h": 0.010256562165600114}, {"text": "/10", "x": 0.8847736621886957, "y": 0.8749999999379179, "w": 0.02880658467610675, "h": 0.01162790690711002}, {"w": 0.0246913570827908, "x": 0.8950617291232137, "text": "97", "h": 0.014534882885320566, "y": 0.9389534889715839}]